#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Impormasyon tungkol sa IBM Quantum sa IBM Cloud logging"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Pag-log para sa IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Pag-log para sa IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga serbisyo ng IBM Cloud&reg;, tulad ng IBM Quantum Compute Service, ay gumagawa ng mga platform log na magagamit mo para imbestigahan ang hindi normal na aktibidad at mahahalagang aksyon sa iyong account, at para malutas ang mga problema.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Magagamit mo ang [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) na isang platform service, para i-route ang mga platform log sa iyong account patungo sa destinasyon na gusto mo sa pamamagitan ng pag-configure ng tenant na nagtatakda kung saan ipapadala ang mga platform log. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [About Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Magagamit mo ang [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) para i-visualize at makatanggap ng alerto sa mga platform log na ginawa sa iyong account at na-route ng IBM Cloud Logs Routing patungo sa isang IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Mga lokasyon kung saan ginagawa ang mga platform log {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "Ang IBM Cloud Container Registry ay gumagawa ng mga platform log na ipinapakita sa iyong mga logging instance. Inililista ng sumusunod na talahanayan ang mga lokasyon kung saan pinagana ang awtomatikong koleksyon ng mga Container Registry service log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Lokasyon                   | Available ba ang mga platform services log? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                    Oo                       |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                    Oo                       |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Mga platform log na ginagawa {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "Ang IBM Quantum Compute Service ay gumagawa ng mga platform services log na ipinapakita sa iyong mga logging instance para sa mga sumusunod na partikular na kaso:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Kapag nagbago ang estado ng isang job.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Pagtingin sa mga log mula sa pahina ng Observability {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Para sa impormasyon tungkol sa paglulunsad ng IBM Cloud Logs interface, tingnan ang **Launching the UI** sa [IBM Cloud Logs documentation.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Mga field ayon sa uri ng log {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Para sa impormasyon tungkol sa mga field na kasama sa bawat platform log, tingnan ang [Fields that are included in platform logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga sumusunod na field ay kasama sa log record.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Field           | Uri     | Paglalarawan                                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|---------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Tinutukoy ang account at flow log instance kung saan na-publish ang log.                 |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Tinutukoy kung nag-iingat ang IBM ng kopya ng record para sa mga layuning operasyonal.   |\n"
"| message         | Required | Paglalarawan ng log na ginawa.                                                            |\n"
